From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 15:58:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] fix(frontend): add missing imports causing render-time
 ReferenceErrors

Eight components referenced identifiers in JSX that were never imported.
Vite/rolldown strips types without checking them, so `npm run build`
stayed green while these pages would throw ReferenceError on render.
`tsc -b` reported them as TS2304 "Cannot find name".

- AnalyticsDashboard: List, ListItem, ListItemText
- SettingsPanel: MenuItem (insurance select)
- Admin: Paper
- ApiKeys: TextField
- Codebook: Grid, MenuItem
- DiagnosticForm: Avatar
- Documents: TableContainer
- Calendar: toast (react-hot-toast default import)

TS2304 count: 35 -> 0. Vite build still green. No behavioural changes
beyond the imports themselves.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X7MMPXSe1wrfLp4QcSDBbt
